SUMMARY:2026 Gender Studies Symposium Art Show Reception
DESCRIPTION:For more information about this year's participating artists 
 and additional details about the exhibit\, please visit the symposium web
 site (https://college.lclark.edu/departments/gender_studies/symposium/45t
 h-annual-gender-studies-symposium/).
