X-LIVEWHALE-SUMMARY:<p>\n  <span style="text-decoration: underline\;"><st
 rong>March event postponed to April:</strong></span> Join us for the <str
 ong>2026 L&amp\;C Athletics Virtual Series</strong>\, a dynamic collectio
 n of conversations that bring the L&amp\;C community together from across
  the globe. This series offers an insider's look at the <strong>"Pursuit 
 of Excellence" within L&amp\;C Athletics\, featuring a unique 360-degree 
 perspective from our dedicated coaches\, inspiring current student-athlet
 es\, and successful alumni.</strong>\n</p>
