SUMMARY:Dedication of Oliver Milavetz's Memorial Bench
DESCRIPTION:While Oliver's birthday is March 20th\, we have chosen to gat
 her on the 19th to better allow for his friends\, classmates\, and the L&
 amp\;C community to attend and reflect together. Our hope is to establish
  this as a lasting space for connection and "Oliverness" on our campus.  
 This will be a casual\, open space to reflect and connect. We'll be honor
 ing Oliver's birthday with cupcakes and wishes\, alongside a river rock p
 ainting activity. Paint a stone to leave at the bench as a lasting tribut
 e\, or take one home with you.  If you cannot make it at 10:00 AM\, we en
 courage you to visit the bench at the Alumni Gatehouse Patio at any time 
 during the day to share a quiet moment or leave a memory.RSVP: To help us
  ensure we have enough supplies and refreshments for everyone\, please le
 t us know if you plan to attend:RSVP via this link (https://engage.lclark
 .edu/register/?id=fc19af12-c9ee-4b59-b0f9-65d2f5f7e3e8)  Sincerely\,  Alu
 mni and Parent Engagement Office Team
