 d/45/width/305/height/229/112289_oliver.webp 3x" data-origin="responsive"
 /><source type="image/jpeg" srcset="https://www.lclark.edu/live/image/sca
 le/2x/gid/45/width/305/height/229/112289_oliver.rev.1772583673.jpg 2x\, h
