 289_oliver.rev.1772583673.jpg 3x" data-origin="responsive"/><img width="3
 05" height="229" alt="Oliver and friends" data-alt="Oliver and friends" d
 ata-caption="Oliver and friends" src="https://www.lclark.edu/live/image/g
 id/45/width/305/height/229/112289_oliver.rev.1772583673.jpg" srcset="http
