 _oliver.rev.1772583673.jpg 2x\, https://www.lclark.edu/live/image/scale/3
 x/gid/45/width/305/height/229/112289_oliver.rev.1772583673.jpg 3x" data-m
 ax-w="2856" data-max-h="2142" loading="lazy" data-optimized="true"/></pic
 ture></p><p data-path-to-node="6">  While Oliver's birthday is March 20th
 \, we have chosen to gather on the 19th to better allow for his friends\,
  classmates\, and the L&amp\;C community to attend and reflect together. 
 Our hope is to establish this as a lasting space for connection and "Oliv
 erness" on our campus.</p><p data-path-to-node="15">  This will be a casu
 al\, open space to reflect and connect. We'll be honoring Oliver's birthd
 ay with <strong data-index-in-node="99" data-path-to-node="15">cupcakes a
 nd wishes</strong>\, alongside a <strong data-index-in-node="132" data-pa
 th-to-node="15">river rock painting activity</strong>. Paint a stone to l
 eave at the bench as a lasting tribute\, or take one home with you.</p><p
  data-path-to-node="16">  If you cannot make it at 10:00 AM\, we encourag
 e you to visit the bench at the Alumni Gatehouse Patio at any time during
  the day to share a quiet moment or leave a memory.<br /><br /><strong da
 ta-index-in-node="0" data-path-to-node="8">RSVP:</strong> To help us ensu
 re we have enough supplies and refreshments for everyone\, please let us 
 know if you plan to attend:<br /><a title="https://engage.lclark.edu/regi
 ster/?id=fc19af12-c9ee-4b59-b0f9-65d2f5f7e3e8" href="https://engage.lclar
 k.edu/register/?id=fc19af12-c9ee-4b59-b0f9-65d2f5f7e3e8" target="_blank" 
