 h and storage\, it’s nearly impossible to keep up to date. Our conferenc
 e is designed to help. We’ve assembled a combination of Best-in-Breed ha
 rdware and software solutions\, along with local experts and organizatio
 ns to help educate\, advise and connect you to resources that can help y
 ou meet your goals.&#13\;\n&#13\;\nCovering Information Security\, Infra
 structure\, Cloud\, Disaster Recovery\, Communications\, and more\, you’
 ll find presentations\, panel discussions\, and exhibitors covering a va
 riety of topics\, as well as the latest innovations and best practices.\
