CREATED;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260304T033951Z
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260319T150000
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260319T110000
DTSTAMP;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260304T033951Z
LAST-MODIFIED;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260304T033951Z
UID:http://calagator.org/events/1250482490
DESCRIPTION:Oregon's Flagship Startup Hiring Event&#13\;\n&#13\;\n​The Or
 egon Hiring Festival brought to you by MeeBoss\, Oregon Entrepreneur Net
 work [OEN]\, and WeWork\, is HERE! We'll be bringing together 10+ hiring
  companies and ~100+ job seekers for an afternoon of matchmaking\, conve
 rsation\, and in-person connections.&#13\;\n&#13\;\n​Here’s how it works
 : once you register\, MeeBoss will get your open roles live within 48 ho
 urs. Our match-first\, chat-first platform connects you directly with qu
 alified candidates ahead of time so you can begin conversations online b
 efore the event. Then\, at the festival\, you’ll meet those candidates f
 ace-to-face at your booth\, alongside new walk-ups who discover your tea
 m on the spot.&#13\;\n&#13\;\n​​To keep things flowing smoothly\, the hi
 ring block runs for three hours straight. While some job seekers step ou
 t for lunch or attend the panel discussion\, others stay engaged at the 
 booths. Creating a natural rotation and steady candidate flow without ov
 erwhelming lines. Please bring more then one person to support your boot
 h.&#13\;\n&#13\;\n​​This streamlined format guarantees high-quality inte
 ractions while giving you the buzz\, PR spotlight\, and networking energ
 y of a full-day festival\, but without requiring your team to commit an 
 entire day.\n\nTags: hiring\, meeboss\, oen\, hr\n\nImported from: http:
 //calagator.org/events/1250482490
URL:https://luma.com/sdvngfhr
SUMMARY:MeeBoss Hiring Festival – Startup Registration
SEQUENCE:1
END:VEVENT
