ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://multcolib.org/sites/default/files/styles
 /medium/public/2026-01/Camera_Nature.jpg?itok=8gNcriwx
DESCRIPTION:This introductory course is designed for absolute beginners an
 d those looking to move beyond automatic camera settings. Participants wil
 l learn the fundamental technical and creative principles that underpin gr
 eat photography. Over the the course\, we will demystify the core function
 s of a camera and explore how to use light\, composition\, and exposure co
 ntrols to capture compelling images.
LOCATION:North Portland Library
URL:https://multcolib.org/events-classes/intro-digital-photography
X-SOURCE:Multnomah County Library
END:VEVENT
