DESCRIPTION:Join us for LEGO Free Play every third Thursday of the month!
  Explore your creativity and spend the afternoon making masterpieces out 
 of the legendary\, colorful building blocks. We’ll provide the LEGOs\, y
 ou provide imagination! Bring a friend and build!\nAll materials remain at
  the library for future programs.  For children and tweens through age 13
 . Children must be accompanied by an adult.
