 sh herbs.      </p></li></ul><hr /><h3><strong>Salad</strong></h3><ul><li
 ><p><strong>Mediterranean Kachumber‑Style Salad</strong><br />        A
  refreshing diced salad of fresh vegetables with citrus and mint.      </
 p></li></ul><hr /><h3><strong>Accompaniments</strong></h3><ul><li><p><str
 ong>Sweet Mango &amp\; Red Pepper Relish</strong><br />        A lightly 
 spiced mango garnish with a sweet‑heat balance.      </p></li><li><p><s
 trong>Mint &amp\; Cucumber Yogurt</strong><br />        Cool\, creamy yog
 urt with herbs and cucumber      </p></li></ul></div><div></div><div>  Wi
 th gratitude to Chef Moody and the Bon Appetit staff. Please note the adj
 usted closing hour of 7pm due to the commencement of Spring Break.</div><
 div>  Thank you!</div>
