DESCRIPTION:<p><b>Calling all tree-planters! Your help is needed to plant h
 undreds of native trees and shrubs at Hidden Falls Natural Area! </b>Our go
 al is to enhance the upland habitat of this neighborhood gem.</p><p>Please 
 arrive by 8:45am to sign-in and be assigned a planting crew. The planting s
 tarts at 9:00am. We provide gloves\, tools\, and planting guidance\, as wel
 l as breakfast snacks and coffee/tea/hot chocolate -- all you need to do is
  show up dressed for the weather wearing sturdy shoes or boots\, and be rea
 dy to have fun!</p><p><b>How do I register? </b>Register by filling out <b>
 <a href="https://www.tfaforms.com/4840511?tfa_26=a0TPa00000soS5l&tfa_2189=H
 idden%20Falls%20Natural%20Area%20planting\,%20Happy%20Valley&tfa_31=a0VPa00
 00098L7x&tfa_45=Tree%20Planter\,%20%20at%20March%2021\,%202026%20at%208:45%
 20am&tfa_2190=2026-03-21&tfa_49=4.25&tfa_886=Standard%20FOT&tfa_51=offsite"
  target="_blank">this quick form</a></b>.  Groups\, families\, and individu
 als welcome!</p><p><b>Under age 18?</b> We request that youth 15 and under 
 volunteer with a parent/guardian.  Youth 16 and older can volunteer on thei
 r own and will need to hand us a <b><u><a href="http://friendsoftrees.org/y
 outhwaiver" target="_blank"><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u
 ><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u>youth waiver form</u></u></u></u></u></u>
 </u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u
 ></u></u></a></u></b> signed by their parent/guardian.</p><p><b>Questions? 
  </b>Pl<u></u>ease check out our <a href="https://friendsoftrees.org/volunt
 eer-faq/" target="_blank"><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><b><u>Volunteer 
 FAQ webpage</u></b></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></a>.  Our t
 eam is also happy to assist! <a href="mailto:Volunteer@friendsoftrees.org" 
 target="_blank"><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><b><u>volunteer@fr<u></u>i
 endsoftrees.or<u></u>g</u></b></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u><
 /a> / 503-595-0213 We look forward to working together soon!<br></p><b><hr 
 /></b><p>This event in partnership with City of Happy Valley.</p>
