X-SOURCE:Meetup Portland City Walking
UID:event_313670351@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260318T060609Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260326T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260326T120000
SUMMARY:THURSDAY **10 AM** Holman Lane to Pittock Mansion 
DESCRIPTION:Portland City Trail Walking Group\nAbout 5 miles out-and-back from the Holman Lane trailhead next to 3509 NW Raleigh St up to the Pittock Mansion on a lovely forested path.\n\nThere is a good amount of elevation gain (833 feet)\, but we take a moderate pace\, and we usually stop for 15 to 20 minutes at the top to take in the views and chit chat.\nOptional lunch/snacks at Elephants Deli afterwards.\nCome hang out with us!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/portland-city-walking-and-trail-walking-meetup-group/events/313670351/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260306T193929Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260306T193929Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/7/d/7/e/600_529352126.jpeg
END:VEVENT
