UID:691cf2a40d45944c9e67742a@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Thursdays\, January 8 - March 26\nThese free Citizenship class
 es are designed to prepare learners for the U.S. naturalization interview 
 and exam\, which includes an assessment of English reading and writing abi
 lities\, U.S. history\, and government. Study ONLINE or IN-PERSON.\nPartic
 ipants will:\nStudy U.S. history and civics lessons (100 questions on citi
 zenship exam)\nImprove your English speaking\, listening\, writing\, and r
 eading\nPractice for the naturalization interview\nSign up at:\nhttps://so
 arlegal.org/our-services/citizenship-classes/\nFor more information\, call
  (503) 379-1598 or email\njstephenson@emoregon.org
LOCATION:Hillsboro Public Library\, Brookwood
