UID:6994e7f96724c63d00f35ad8@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:A very special guest STEM program from our partners with the M
 IT Public Library Innovation Exchange (PLIX). All ages can come and get "c
 ertified" in Material Science through a series of hands-on crafts and expe
 riments. Can you keep the cat dry? What would keep it warm in the winter? 
