SUMMARY: Candlelight: Coldplay & Imagine Dragons
DESCRIPTION:⭐ Candlelight concerts bring the magic of a live\, multi-sens
 ory musical experience to awe-inspiring locations like never seen before 
 in Portland. Get your tickets now to discover the music of Coldplay & Ima
 gine Dragons at The Old Church Concert Hall under the gentle glow of cand
 lelight.\n\nGeneral Info\n📍 Venue: The Old Church Concert Hall\n📅 Dates
  and times: select your dates/times directly in the ticket selector\n⏳ Du
 ration: 60 minutes. Doors open 45 minutes before the show and close 5 min
 utes prior to the start. Late arrivals will not be permitted\n👤 Age requ
 irement: 8 years old or older. Anyone under the age of 16 must be accompa
 nied by an adult\n♿ Accessibility: this venue is ADA compliant\n❓ View th
 e FAQs for this event here https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vR
 s-D__FdPjpAauRS7qaQ3ZhqaiH4P3e-CRhZWI4XCpWJLaRMAAO8WfAupYjEj8rhTxZE0LzCbO
 9dpJ/pub\n🪑 Seating is assigned on a first come first served basis in ea
 ch zone\n🕯️ If you would like to book a private concert or buy regular t
