  the upcoming 26/27 academic year? A student job gives you real world exp
 erience that is flexible with your class schedule. Find out more informat
 ion at the Job Fair featured at our upcoming Spring Week of Welcome event
  happening the first week of Spring Term 2026.There will also be the Pass
 ports to Success activity. Complete your passport by collecting stamps fr
 om around campus and earn a $15 voucher redeemable at any PCC Cafeteria.S
 pring Week of Welcome Student Job Fair &amp\; Passports to Success is hap
 pening from 10am–2pm daily at the following locations:Monday\, March 30
 : Rock Creek Bldg 5 Room 122Tuesday\, March 31: Sylvania CC Main MallWedn
 esday\, April 1: Southeast MTH Great HallThursday\, April 2: Cascade 2nd 
 Floor Lobby &amp\; Rooms 202\, 203\, 204The division of Student Wellbeing
 \, Engagement and Belonging (SWEB) is hiring including:Associated Student
 s of Portland Community CollegeCivic Leadership DevelopmentMulticultural 
