  event is FREE and in-person only. Only PCC students currently taking cla
 sses may participate. Supplies are limited and will be offered on a first
 -come\, first-served basis at the time of the event. We cannot ship items
  to students and/or set items aside to be picked up later.Spring Week of 
 Welcome Job Fair with Passports to Success is brought to you by Student E
 ngagement. The office of Student Engagement is pleased to offer accommoda
