SUMMARY:Farias Dissertation Defense
DESCRIPTION:Araceli Farias\, a candidate in the Doctor of Education in Le
 adership Program\, will defend her dissertation at 2:30 PM PT on Monday\,
  March 30\, 2026 in Corbett 112.  Her dissertation is titled "Authentic L
 atino (Im)migrant Family Engagement\," and the chair of her committee is 
 Dr. Alejandra Favela.  This event is open to the public.  The presentatio
 n may be viewed via Zoom (https://lclark-edu.zoom.us/j/99127190568?pwd=qs
 ww4ZTDupndeKbEa7Lembv4rddlra.1).
