 heet of paper\n-Pencil\, erasers and sharpener\n-Marker\n-Ruler with shap
 e stencils\n-Detailed instructions and examples for creating your own map!
 \nRegister\nto reserve your kit and pick it up at West Slope Library at yo
 ur convenience any time from March 1st-31st* during the library's open hou
 rs. Some kits will also be available for pick up at the library\, no reser
 vation required.\nWe can't wait to see what you create! Send your picture 
 by email to\nwestslope@wccls.org\nor tag us on Instagram @gardenhomecommun
 itylibrary\n*Reserved kits not picked up by March 31st will be offered to 
