DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260401T023000Z
UID:6973bfd4834cbb3dea28e810@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join Librarian Doug at Stickmen Brewing (19475 SW 118th Ave ST
 E 1\, Tualatin\, OR 97062) for several rounds of trivia! Enjoy fabulous d
