DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260401T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260401T113000
SUMMARY:Women's Wednesday👟👟 Wanderers  Tryon Creek 4 mile Loop
DESCRIPTION:Women's Wednesday👟👟 Wanderers\n"Ladies only"\, sorry guys.\n**Let’s get out once a month and go for a hike…or maybe just a simple walk! Nothing crazy.**\nCome explore with me\, on our casual hike around NW trails. Our “adventures” will last an hour to 90 minutes covering 2 to 5 miles followed by coffee and munchies. We’re just after some fresh air\, some fun and fitness with a group of likeminded women. If you’re looking for an inclusive\, welcoming and fun fitness experience with like minded women perhaps this is a great fit. Yes\, this is an exclusively all women’s group.\nWe’ll meet new people\, have fun socializing in the outdoors and share some trail camaraderie.\nThis month\, we’ll explore the beautiful trails of Tryon Creek trails. All you need is a pair of running shoes\, trail running shoes or hiking shoes\, a water bottle\, some comfortable clothes and you’re set!\nStart Time: 9:30 rain or shine...\n**Meeting location:** Tryon Creek Nature Center\, 11321 SW Terwilliger Blvd. There is a new parking fee of $10 unless you buy a annual permit. To avoid this charge park on the street and walk in.\n\n* Start point: Vistor's Center\n* End point: Vistor'[s Center\n* Hike Type: Loop\, not paved\n* Distance: 4 miles\n* Elevation gain: Not much\n* High Point: ?\n* Difficulty: Easy\n* Seasons: All year\n* Please remember that I am simply a volunteer hiker willing to lead a hike. I am not a professional hiking guide nor do I receive compensation for leading these hikes. You are responsible for your own safety and comfort.\n* **No dogs\, kids or music please!**\n* **Have more questions? Ask Debra 503-312-5728**\n* Mark your calendar for May 6th our next adventure! Details to follow.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/womens-wednesday-wanderers/events/313222187/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260205T160454Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260205T160454Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/8/5/2/f/600_525034095.jpeg
END:VEVENT
