 in-person only. Only PCC students currently taking classes may participat
 e. Supplies are limited and will be offered on a first-come\, first-serve
 d basis at the time of the event. We cannot ship items to students and/or
  set items aside to be picked up later.Spring Week of Welcome Job Fair wi
 th Passports to Success is brought to you by Student Engagement. The offi
 ce of Student Engagement is pleased to offer accommodations to ensure tha
 t our programs are accessible and inclusive. Please email a request\, que
