UID:698fbab48d5e2d09335f15dd@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Spread native wildflowers this spring with DIY seed bombs and 
 launchers! Learn about how seeds grow\, and what types of wild plants flou
 rish in the Pacific Northwest. All participants will make a seed bomb out 
 of seeds\, clay\, and soil with launchers to send their seeds into the wil
 d. For children ages 5 and up with adult supervision.
