DESCRIPTION:Meet the artists. Experience the exhibits. Join the conversati
 on.\nJoin us at Brookwood Library for an evening celebrating our current g
 allery exhibits. Enjoy a brief Q&A\, explore the artwork\, and connect wit
 h the artists. Light refreshments provided while supplies last.\nAll are w
 elcome.\nFeaturing:\nCHEX\n— Kaitlyn Carr\nCut it Out: Fun and Games\n
 — Amy Mower\, Cherie Savoie Tintary\nNewspaper Poems: Collage from Text\
 n— Wendy Turner Swanson
