 e some prompt cards to get conversations flowing\, but no more structure.
  Be in community\, enjoy a cup of coffee\, and catch up!  &#160\;This eve
 nt is a part of the Division of Student Life Staff Social Morale Committe
 e (https://www.lclark.edu/student_life/for-student-life-staff/social-mora
 le-committee/). Participation is open to all professional Student Life st
 aff.
