DESCRIPTION:⭐ Candlelight concerts bring the magic of a live\, multi-sens
 ory musical experience to awe-inspiring locations like never seen before 
 in Portland. Get your tickets now to discover the music of 90s Unplugged 
 at The Old Church Concert Hall under the gentle glow of candlelight.\n\nG
 eneral Info\n📍 Venue: The Old Church Concert Hall\n📅 Dates and times: s
 elect your dates/times directly in the ticket selector\n⏳ Duration: 60 mi
 nutes. Doors open 45 minutes before the show and close 5 minutes prior to
  the start. Late arrivals will not be permitted\n👤 Age requirement: 8 ye
