  - Lenny Kravitz\n  * Hallelujah - Jeff Buckley\n  * Tears in Heaven - Er
 ic Clapton\n  * Smells Like Teen Spirit - Nirvana\n\nPerformers\n\n  * Li
 steso String Quartet
