DESCRIPTION:Curious about artificial intelligence (AI) but not sure where 
 to start? This hands-on workshop is designed for adults with little or no 
 tech background who want to understand what AI is\, how it’s used in eve
 ryday life\, and how to try it themselves. We’ll break down big concepts
  into simple language and provide easy\, guided activities to explore how 
 AI tools like chatbots and image generators work.
