SUMMARY:Lyric Journeying with Poet Kim Stafford
DESCRIPTION:&#160\;How writing along the way can turn you from tourist to
  traveler\, intruder to pilgrim.    &#160\;
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<blockquote><h3><em><span data-originalfonts
 ize="14pt" data-originalcomputedfontsize="18.666666">&#160\;</span></em><
 /h3><h3><em><span data-originalfontsize="14pt" data-originalcomputedfonts
 ize="18.666666">How writing along the way can turn you from tourist to tr
 aveler\, intruder to pilgrim.</span></em></h3><p>    &#160\;  </p><p><em>
 <span data-originalfontsize="14pt" data-originalcomputedfontsize="18.6666
 66"><picture class="lw_image lw_image112231  lw_align_center"><source typ
 e="image/webp" srcset="https://www.lclark.edu/live/image/gid/675/width/33
 8/height/450/112231_IMG_0144.webp 1x" data-origin="responsive"/><source t
 ype="image/jpeg" srcset="https://www.lclark.edu/live/image/gid/675/width/
 338/height/450/112231_IMG_0144.rev.1772215673.jpg 1x" data-origin="respon
 sive"/><img alt="" width="338" height="450" data-alt="" data-decoration="
 true" src="https://www.lclark.edu/live/image/gid/675/width/338/height/450
 /112231_IMG_0144.rev.1772215673.jpg" title="IMG 0144" data-max-w="338" da
 ta-max-h="450" loading="lazy" data-optimized="true"/></picture></span></e
 m></p></blockquote>
