DESCRIPTION:The American Red Cross offers a one-hour introduction to Inter
 national Humanitarian Law which is also known as the Law of Armed Confli
 ct or the Law of War. The one-hour class provides an introduction to the d
 evelopment of the laws of war in the nineteenth century\, the main princip
 les of this law and the role of the Red Cross in its creation and maintena
 nce.
