BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Wccls Library": "https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/699f9fb58b29ea2800d28bc4"}
X-SOURCE-ID:wccls_library
SUMMARY:Makerspace Open Lab
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260408T003000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260408T023000Z
UID:699f9fb58b29ea2800d28bc4@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Makerspace Open Labs are for anyone who wants to check out the
  space and use our equipment to make cool things. Room assistants are avai
 lable to guide you in the basic use of the tools and technology. Come in w
 ith an idea and leave with a finished project! For more information about 
 the Makerspace and its resources\,\nsee here\n.\nMakerspace Open Labs take
  place on the following weekly schedule:\nTuesdays\n\, 5:30 - 7:30PM\nThur
 sdays\n\, 4:00 - 6:00PM\nSaturdays\n\, 10:00 AM - 1:00PM\nSundays\n\, 1:30
  - 5:30P\nEach month we provide the materials\, tools and instructions for
  a featured Makerspace project that everyone is invited to try.\nApril's f
 eatured project is Seed Paper bookmarks (pictured).\nIMPORTANT:\nAdults us
 ing the Makerspace for the first time need to\nsign a waiver\n\; people un
 der the age of 18 must have a waiver signed by a parent or guardian.\nYou 
 can sign and submit waivers online here.
LOCATION:Tualatin Public Library\, Makerspace
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/699f9fb58b29ea2800d28bc4
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Wccls Library": "https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69a22242b0595799c09fde6c"}
X-SOURCE-ID:wccls_library
SUMMARY:Shameless Romance Book Club
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260408T013000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260408T023000Z
UID:69a22242b0595799c09fde6c@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Our Shameless Romance Book Club’s next read is\nShe Doesn't 
 Have a Clue\nby Jenny Elder!\nA high-end wedding on a private island sound
 s like something out of a dream\, but when the groom is your editor and ex
 -fiancé\, it’s more like a nightmare. Bestselling mystery author Kate V
 alentine planned to get through the ordeal with fake smiles\, that is unti
 l the bride is poisoned\, and Kate is the one to discover the body. Now Ka
 te finds herself in a real-life mystery that is shockingly similar to the 
 plot of her latest novel. And the only person who seems willing to help Ka
 te catch the killer is her biggest romantic regret\, Jake Hawkins. Kate is
  a pro at solving fictional mysteries\, but are her skills only make belie
 ve? Or can she and Jake catch the culprit before it’s too late?\nReserve
  a copy here\n. Also available in eBook\, downloadable audiobook\, and pr
 eloaded audiobook (Playaway) formats.\nWant to read ahead?\nCheck out the
  Shameless Romance Book Club’s schedule and titles for the rest of 2026!
LOCATION:Aloha Community Library
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69a22242b0595799c09fde6c
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Wccls Library": "https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69a1e1dc8b29ea2800d2ea13"}
X-SOURCE-ID:wccls_library
SUMMARY:Virtual Nerd Night: Trivia for Adults
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260408T013000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260408T024500Z
UID:69a1e1dc8b29ea2800d2ea13@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:How much do you know about the four themed sets of questions? 
 Themes change monthly. You can play solo but we include hard questions and
  recommend playing as a team (up to 5 people). For Prizes we give out poi
 nts – which can be used at a future trivia night - to those with the hig
 hest and lowest number of correct answers.\nThe freebie question\, answer 
 sheet and meeting details will be emailed to registrants around noon on t
 he day of the event. We will also send this out to late registrants around
  6 pm.
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69a1e1dc8b29ea2800d2ea13
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
