DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260410T003000Z
UID:69a1e117ec71a31f5b417428@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Places can really make an impression on you\, learn how to tak
 e your own impressions from places and bring them with you  using a uniq
 ue on the go printing technique.\nLearn to spot textures and to print them
  in your own travel journal. All materials provided.\nFor ages 12-18.
