SUMMARY:2026 Social Change Symposium | Campus-Community Collaborations fo
 r Change
DESCRIPTION:Portland Metro Area higher ed students\, faculty\, staff\, an
 d community partners are invited to register for this year's symposium!&#
 160\;How are Oregon colleges and universities engaging with and in commun
 ities in these trying times?&#160\;Join the Oregon Service-Learning &amp\
 ; Community Engagement (ORSLCE) Professionals for this story-sharing\, co
 mmunity-building\, strategy-enhancing meeting. We'll have an exciting key
 note speaker\, interactive workshops\, panel discussions and more.—Even
 t Details: https://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id=382430 (https://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?i
 d=382430)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:Portland Metro Area higher ed students\, fac
 ulty\, staff\, and community partners are invited to register for this ye
 ar's symposium!&#160\;<br />How are Oregon colleges and universities enga
 ging with and in communities in these trying times?&#160\;<br />Join the 
 Oregon Service-Learning &amp\; Community Engagement (ORSLCE) Professional
