DESCRIPTION:<p><b>=======</b></p><p><b>Due to popular interest\, this event
  is<u> full and closed</u>. </b>Please consider any of our other open event
 s - we hope to work with you soon!</p><p><b>=======</b></p><p><b>Join Frien
 ds of Trees for some planting fun with the City of Tualatin -- we'll be pla
 nting native trees and shrubs at Brown's Ferry Park to enhance habitat and 
 support a healthy Tualatin River Watershed! </b></p><p>Please arrive by 8:4
 5am to sign-in and be assigned a planting crew. The planting starts at 9:00
 am. We provide gloves\, tools\, and planting guidance\, as well as breakfas
 t snacks and coffee/tea/hot chocolate -- all you need to do is show up dres
 sed for the weather wearing sturdy shoes or boots\, and be ready to have fu
 n!</p><p><b>Under age 18?</b> We request that youth 15 and under volunteer 
 with a parent/guardian.  Youth 16 and older can volunteer on their own and 
 will need to hand us a <b><u><a href="http://friendsoftrees.org/youthwaiver
 " target="_blank"><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u>
 <u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u>youth waiver form</u></u></u></u></u></u><
 /u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u>
 </u></u></u></u></u></a></u></b> signed by their parent/guardian.</p><p><b>
 Questions?  </b>Please check out our <b><u><a href="https://friendsoftrees.
 org/volunteer-faq/" target="_blank"><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u>
 <u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u>Volunteer FAQ webpage</u
 ></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></
 u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></a></u></b>.  Our team is also h
 appy to assist!  You can reach Cece and Jenny at <a href="mailto:Volunteer@
 friendsoftrees.org" target="_blank"><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u>
 <u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><b><u>volunteer@friendsoftr
 ees.org</u></b></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u>
 </u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></a>\, 503-595-0213
 . We look forward to planting together soon!</p><p>===</p><p>Thank you to o
 ur event sponsors\, <a href="https://portlandgeneral.com/" target="_blank">
 <u><u><u>Portland General Electric</u></u></u></a> &amp\; <a href="https://
 hartmannforbes.com/" target="_blank"><u>Hartmann &amp\; Forbes</u></a>.</p>
 <p>===</p><b><hr /></b><p>This event in partnership with City of Tualatin.<
 /p>
