 ting blood\, platelets or plasma. The American Red Cross is partnering wi
 th PCC's Office of Civic Leadership Development to host a blood drive at 
 the PCC Cascade Campus.<br />Save your spot by going to <a href="https://
 www.redcrossblood.org/give.html/find-drive" target="_blank">https://www.r
 edcrossblood.org/give.html/find-drive</a> and enter in sponsor code PCCCA
 SCADE You can save time at the drive by entering information through the 
