 able for it&#13\;\n## Agenda:&#13\;\n&#13\;\n10 AM - Arrival: Head to th
 e top by the glass rooms&#13\;\n10:15 AM - Introductions:&#13\;\nShare y
 our name&#13\;\nDiscuss your current projects or interests. If you don’t
