BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Japanese Garden": "https://japanesegarden.org/events/bonsai-week/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:japanese_garden
X-SOURCE:Japanese Garden
UID:5307@japanesegarden.org
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260421
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260429
DTSTAMP:20260312T213257Z
URL:https://japanesegarden.org/events/bonsai-week/
SUMMARY:Bonsai Week
DESCRIPTION:\nA guest takes a closer look at bonsai on the Ellie M. Hill Bonsai Terrace. Photo by Julie Gursha.\n\n\n\nJoin us for Bonsai Week at Portland Japanese Garden as we celebrate the return of our beloved bonsai collection and explore the artistry\, history\, and cultural significance of these extraordinary living sculptures.\n\n\n\nThroughout the week\, visitors are invited to discover the beauty and craftsmanship of bonsai and learn more about this timeless art form at the Garden. As these tiny trees return to our Ellie M. Hill Bonsai Terrace and Jubitz Oregon Terrace\, come celebrate their beauty through special activities in the Family Studio\, bonsai-themed items in the Gift Shop\, and more! We'll also have a delightful opportunity to learn more about bonsai in our new Experience Center (formerly the Membership Center)\, nestled within our Historic Garden spaces.\n\n\n\nThe Return of the Bonsai\n\n\n\nOur cherished bonsai collection\, on loan from local bonsai practitioners\, returns beginning April 21\, offering guests the opportunity to experience these carefully cultivated miniature landscapes up close. Each tree reflects decades of thoughtful care\, patience\, and artistic vision.\n\n\n\nA family checking out bonsai on the Ellie M. Hill  Bonsai Terrace. Photo by Julie Gursha.\n\n\n\nRelated: Learn More About Bonsai at Portland Japanese Garden\n\n\n\nPlan Your Visit\n\n\n\nBonsai Week is included with regular Garden admission.\n\n\n\nAdditional details and programming will be announced soon.\n\n\n\n\nBuy Tickets\n\n
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://wpmedia.japanesegarden.org/w:2560/h:1703/q:mauto/process:45114/id:f9d089a4d65c9edb68010117949329d7/https://japanesegarden.org/viewer.jpg
CATEGORIES:Botanical Exhibitions,Special Events
LOCATION:Portland Japanese Garden\, 611 SW Kingston Ave.\, Portland\, OR\, 97205\, United States
GEO:45.51862;-122.70843109999998
