 -table-talks
LAST-MODIFIED:20260312T174130Z
ATTACH:https://www.lclark.edu/live/image/gid/239/width/80/height/80/crop/
 1/src_region/0,48,1545,1592/111656_Spring_26_First_Gen_Table_Talks_1.rev.
