UID:69aa2cdf4dacf581ff7ff0b6@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Full STEAM Ahead is a series of classes where we will explore 
 science concepts through art projects.\nIn April we are exploring the envi
 ronment around us here in the suburbs by making art from natural objects f
 ound on our very own Ice Age Trail.\nFor students in grades 3-5.\nRegistra
 tion is required\n. Held in the Makerspace.
