DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Earth Week by caring for native trees and shrubs at t
 his rare weekday event! <u>Note: there will be no tree-planting at this eve
 nt\, and this can be physically-demanding work</u> (great for folks looking
  for a work out!).  Our stewardship events help to ensure the highest level
  of plant survival through the PNW dry summer months ahead.<br><p><b>How do
  I register? </b>Register by filling out <b><a href="https://www.tfaforms.c
 om/4840511?tfa_26=a0TPa00001Edi8l&tfa_2189=Tualatin%20Community%20Park%20St
 ewardship\,%20Tualatin&tfa_31=a0VPa00000DfdEG&tfa_45=%20at%20April%2024\,%2
 02026%20at%208:45%20am&tfa_2190=2026-04-24&tfa_49=3.25&tfa_886=Standard%20F
 OT&tfa_51=offsite" target="_blank"><u><u><u><u><u>this quick form</u></u></
 u></u></u></a></b>.  Groups\, families\, and individuals welcome!</p><u></u
 ><p><b>Please arrive by 8:45am</b> to find our tent and sign-in\, stewardsh
 ip activities start promptly at 9:00am. We provide gloves\, tools\, and gui
 dance. All you need to do is show up dressed for the weather and wearing st
 urdy shoes or boots (no sandals of any kind\, please!) and be ready to have
  fun!</p><p><b>Under age 18?</b> We request that youth 15 and under volunte
 er with a parent/guardian.  Youth 16 and older can volunteer on their own a
 nd will need to hand us a <b><a href="https://friendsoftrees.org/youthwaive
 r" target="_blank"><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u>youth waiver form</u></u><
 /u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></a></b> signed by their parent/guardian.</p
 ><p><b>Questions?  </b>Pl<u></u>ease check out our <a href="https://friends
 oftrees.org/volunteer-faq/" target="_blank"><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><
 u><u><b><u>Volunteer FAQ webpage</u></b></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u
 ></u></u></u></a>.  Our team is also happy to assist! <a href="mailto:Volun
 teer@friendsoftrees.org" target="_blank"><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><
 u><b><u>volunteer@fr<u></u>iendsoftrees.or<u></u>g</u></b></u></u></u></u><
 /u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></a> / 503-595-0213 We look forward to worki
 ng together soon!</p><hr /><p>This event is in partnership with City of Tua
 latin.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260128T221312Z
