 r at the Shute Park Library or the Brookwood Library!\nSpanish-language su
 pport available only at the Shute Park Library.\nVisit our website at\nLib
 rary Bookings - Hillsboro Public Library\nor call\n503-615-6500\nto check 
 appointment availability.
LOCATION:Hillsboro Public Library\, Brookwood
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6996717f6724c63d00f3ab2d
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
