 a Zoom at <a href="https://portlandcc.zoom.us/j/96697103029?pwd=kCGXBO72h
 fCQjIoWk4vNQlEXgPj7St.1" target="_blank">https://portlandcc.zoom.us/j/966
 97103029?pwd=kCGXBO72hfCQjIoWk4vNQlEXgPj7St.1</a><br />The Student Basic 
