 etop board games and card games between classes?We have a multitude of ga
 mes to choose from and experience! Drop by alone or bring friends!Come to
  tabletop Wednesday at the SE Accessibility Hub\, a disability-friendly s
 paceMount Tabor Hall Room 136!Every Wednesday from 10:30am-3:00pmDrop in 
 and say "hi!" We have snacks and hot drinks!Some Games available: Ticket 
 to Ride\, Apples to Apples\, Cranium\, Boss Monster\, Sushi Go!\, Dialect
 \, Unbroken\, and more!—Event Details: https://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id=3819
 97 (https://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id=381997)
