DESCRIPTION:North Plains Public Library Birthday Party- Wednesday\, April
  29\nth\n7:00-8:30 p.m.\nJoin us as we celebrate North Plains Public Libra
 ry's 20th birthday! For twenty years\, the North Plains Public Library has
  been a beacon of light\, illuminating the path of learning and discovery 
 for our community. We invite you to step into the glow of our shared histo
 ry as we celebrate this milestone birthday. Please join us on: Wednesday\,
  April 29th 7:00-8:30 pm\, Where: The North Plains Library\nSweet      Tre
 ats: Enjoy celebratory cupcakes.\nShared      History: A look back at the 
 stories and journeys that shaped us.\nA      Sparkling Surprise: You won
 ’t want to miss what we have in store!
LOCATION:North Plains Public Library
