UID:bb76983d2ddac82f812ccbe4cec71ac2@multcolib.org
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://multcolib.org/sites/default/files/styles
 /medium/public/2025-10/generic_Computers_technology.png?itok=N7qn9WKp
DESCRIPTION:Enhance your professional competencies by beginning to utilize
  the capabilities possible with Microsoft Excel. Students will be introduc
 ed to critical Excel functions such as creating graphs and tables from dat
