X-SOURCE-ID:wccls_library
SUMMARY:Citizenship [at Bethany Library Annex]
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260519T003000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260519T023000Z
UID:69866b60834cbb3dea2c14d0@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Free citizenship classes provided by SOAR Immigration Legal Se
 rvices. Classes are designed to prepare you for the US naturalization inte
 rview and exam. Study US history and civics lessons (100 questions on citi
 zenship exam)\; improve your English speaking\, listening\, writing\, and 
 reading\; practice for the naturalization interview\; and review the N-400
  application. Classes are taught in English\, with resources in Spanish an
 d other languages.
LOCATION:Bethany Library
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69866b60834cbb3dea2c14d0
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Wccls Library": "https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6994ea244a9fd98b7f7eaab4"}
X-SOURCE-ID:wccls_library
SUMMARY:Beginner ESL Class Provided by Goodwill Industries
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260519T003000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260519T023000Z
UID:6994ea244a9fd98b7f7eaab4@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:This class is an introduction to basic grammar\, reading\, wri
 ting\, listening\, and speaking skills for students who can read and write
  in their first language. Students will receive a free textbook as a part
  of the class. We will work together to learn new vocabulary\, sentence pa
 tterns\, and communication using simple English.\nEsta clase es una introd
 ucción a las habilidades básicas de gramática\, lectura\, escritura\, c
 omprensión auditiva y expresión oral para estudiantes que pueden leer y 
 escribir en su primer idioma. Los estudiantes recibirán un libro de texto
  gratuito como parte de la clase. Trabajaremos juntos para aprender vocabu
 lario nuevo\, patrones de oraciones y comunicación usando un inglés simp
 le.
LOCATION:Hillsboro Public Library\, Shute Park
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6994ea244a9fd98b7f7eaab4
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
