 n PDX\n  * Spirits\, mocktails\, beer\, food\, & beverage tastes from loc
 al companies\n  * Meet & connect with fellow Bloody Mary lovers\n  * Phot
 o ops\, temp tattoos\, & more\n  * One vote for The People's Choice award
  for best Bloody Mary in Austin
