 ater\, Lincoln Hall 115\n\nDrop-in format\n\nWork will be curated by facu
 lty and played on a continuous loop.\n\n\nReception\n\n3:30 – 6:30 p.m.\n
 \nLincoln Hall Lobby\n\n
